{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/P_heacGEz0i2w2WA0miSow","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:39.779367+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/P_heacGEz0i2w2WA0miSow","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/7FkcGB3MtHeauNhHxum7nPRsu5iaDSJ5pR4QwicRVqK511BYzILrpTRN2zweBuoibIeEBzjdSibXjrxF6TaYyQDxQGEIe74vwyl5QTuMiayY43sI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2cePuERI4Yw7thYLGTIVzeNl7VZ6pSMdK8NkDRqAxaOZhzuVLySVmjDnicGqb7ibFRIt8aGIPGIUasa7gXTZDOSadzMNllegI2Xc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2f685OY5DL8R5dqJxL7G9vR4tkT36XK4yJDbUJLOWM3EzV4qICYpUQSY03sPeHrB9OtuUCXrXOVStWbzlvdRSjQmWksp2B3PX8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、招生计划</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>具体参考《重庆中医药学院2027年推荐免试硕士研究生专业目录》，以最后确认录取人数为准。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2cARJNOWjOahPII2sARJGcrTppGgF3AgVjCENdOhApJySg7sBDmedEFX2hMqGPHE1gkQR7JFfUrgjoEzwibMR9UicVBqEubiaeZvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2eW4xyobXc0ibSicnEqiczRgIjDZsUfw9n8UJoic4tLZozem6nVenpNPSf5j3HSBHVwGKdPHQyz4FN6Uicqcnr4EcllIwA1vLN1V8sU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、学制及学习形式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>基本学制为三年，学习年限最长不超过六年，学习形式为全日制脱产学习。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2eziclOxZv8ic2K9wqQEqgAKwByeRoncZm8Y59hOzl1yVwMgwYyRISt6wK4MzibbKVic0l2bicRRndRic5AWAKrO5WwAJicfVpMEOxR3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2cbgibIxo9O8w2yKgaicbj2DM24iaLaQ3Xdgy7zRkvWzHuw2icziawMwiaSibHmicxrj91RtPqS7pgtzPSAYgXRtGw3wlzky0XCYFtVoBU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法、人格健全、身体健康的中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人所在学校必须是经教育部批准的具有硕士推荐免试权的高等院校，并获得推荐免试资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.在校期间各方面表现良好，身体健康，学习成绩优秀，具备作为硕士研究生培养的潜质和基础。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.符合我校相应专业的报考条件，详见《重庆中医药学院2027年推荐免试硕士研究生专业目录》相关备注。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.入学前必须取得与专业目录要求相对应的本科毕业证书及学位证书。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2f9al2duodggiaicfE0p8AgGOjzYlX7xPh3z195SNIBSJGSKaDiaLZvpAvNK24CL10Q3Hvob6zicAda1C9F8wwXz5VtbMkw5EXWkpw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2eG67ib8EF71wDibrWHml474XHPB8KSfcicxZh1krWUwyH1Ih2QFaQZ5esmNxiaq2TkYYV3RwuIyOiaLgkqA1XpCkVdGDxmWcal56pw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、接收程序</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）填报志愿、发送复试通知</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><span>推免生须在“中国研究生招生信息网”上“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”填报志愿，经学校二级招生院所初审资格后将及时发送复试通知。推免生在研招网填报志愿时需选择专业及二级招生院所。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（二）登录我校研究生招生管理系统注册填写报名信息并上传复试材料</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>登录我校“重庆中医药学院研究生招生管理系统”（https://pas.cqctcm.edu.cn/），以真实有效信息完成注册并填写报名信息，用于各二级招生院所收集并审核推免生的报名信息。选择二级招生院所、专业，并上传复试材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.重庆中医药学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表（https://yjsy.cqctcm.edu.cn/#/home）研究生院--下载专区；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.重庆中医药学院2027年报考攻读硕士学位研究生政治情况表（https://yjsy.cqctcm.edu.cn/#/home）研究生院--下载专区；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.重庆中医药学院硕士研究生综合考核诚信承诺书（https://yjsy.cqctcm.edu.cn/#/home）研究生院--下载专区；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（电子版）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.自荐信PDF格式（格式不限）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.本科历年学习成绩（须加盖所在学校教务部门印章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.大学英语六级考试成绩单复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>8.获奖证书复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>9.学生证复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>10.身份证复印件。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（三）复试考核</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><span>我校各二级招生院所接收推免生复试考核方式不限，可采用笔试、面试、实践能力考核，其中面试为综合考核的必要环节，按专业（也可按方向）组织专家组进行复试。考核前请及时查看学校研究生院官网通知，也可咨询相关学院。每名考生的复试时间一般不少于20分钟。复试小组成员一般不少于5人，复试小组应对每位考生的作答情况进行现场记录及录音录像，并妥存备查。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（四）完善网上待录取手续</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p><span><span>学校将在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”向复试合格的考生发放待录取通知，推免生须及时接收，否则无法被我校录取。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2fqUZ7CexNicDRjRMyoRsGBeBsr4NLeNy2MCqsjXOqI9U0UVUiaR64TeHP0KH35Zbt6Q8QAeHzr8IhH6EV8lmjGxIkLKRBZFFdw4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2ejqEqWQd7Ttx3nEuy9AR845G1pX50TO9iaoJBPwYpLQ3aaHGRA82yZbFo49psYkgSJBaWhQZvY7GBYpHVHetdo4pibTYS5YiaFLo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、学费及奖助学金</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）所有研究生均须缴纳学费，中医学学术学位硕士和中药学学术学位硕士均为8000元/年，中医专业学位硕士和中药专业学位硕士均为10000元/年。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（二）我校硕士研究生在校期间可获得各类奖学金（国家奖学金、学业奖学金）、助学金（国家助学金、三助岗位津贴）。经济特别困难的研究生可申请助学贷款、缓交学费绿色通道和临时经济困难补助。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2cMUEyLnHZO97UCCRZ1WkxN8ib5oKGuqiaic012P17Py2X8E2sUd52Fdicw9FA5SibhCIZ3eMyoaMPZYVtD0eZD6OlvssmIptnSL0y4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2cNiaPVlLibSCk8ma7OyuIibzkmRPNC7Qno0KfYDZS6c6hxpusyYZZDAuaS0JdfxwPdwjP4iaVSAfTcoIMdxWTC1e4RLSfDRhc8yNU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>六、培养地点及住宿安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>我校硕士研究生主要在重庆中医药学院校本部及附属单位进行培养。录取新生住宿主要安排在重庆中医药学院校本部，部分中医临床专业学位及中药专业学位研究生住宿由学校附属单位统筹安排，具体住宿安排将在报到前对考生公布。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2dKyQlozccvMGCvbHtWI6amnsjsffHuK6cgVIpeIoUAWOZxr4Z8VNnVCDOf4enMqoDHR4XxsSsPrLcWGuMktZ91Cs4ibzErNG6M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2ch0S6cYYWt9G0JesNtRyQFncN8QIh3vxYSBJeYhSJ9RqbPEUDXA8RHicERibVoLyibCicwctuu2QQGjTmicaoIJc7p8rYQzy4Lgj8E/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>七、其他说明</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）考生在报名、复试、录取阶段均不涉及导师，各院系将在拟录取后组织硕士研究生与导师互选工作。具体工作安排另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（二）我校中医硕士专业学位研究生培养与住院医师规范化培训完全对接。凡报考我校中医硕士专业学位的研究生必须无条件参加住院医师规范化培训，研究生须获得“执业医师资格证书”及“住院医师规范化培训合格证书”后方可申请学位。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（三）研究生毕业后能否取得相关专业执业资格证书以国家最新出台的文件为准，我校不承担保证研究生取得执业资格证书的责任。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（四）考生须在拟录取1周内进行体检，身体健康状况须符合国家和我校规定的体检要求，考生不得隐瞒本人病情。若身体状况不符合国家和我校规定的体检要求，将取消入学资格。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（五）学校将于教育部审核通过招生数据后向考生发放录取通知书，入学后三个月内通过新生资格复审后才能取得学籍。若不符合录取条件，无论何时，学校将取消其入学资格或注销学籍。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（六）其他未尽事宜以教育部、重庆市研究生招生相关规定为准。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2erSK0NiaZ40WsDAV8qfvibMpzW9CfUqAWwhss5WKqHAPia3bib8YMOic11EqeAviaSghjeoJhIalPq9hq6TyGawF33QUpHUjRex9NYw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icPMQgcMTD2erkMjaxdHJ9ZTcZg91eWWz6YgYWAVIO0iaF88HVPBjWRDbkicdpmjV5nG2coUwW0P3lvJy5vOq5GVXNdrriaC6HzRwt0jEw2dzsU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p>